    "heading": "One curriculum.",
    "headingEm": "Every stage.",
    "body": [
      "Every Sunbeam classroom follows the CBSE curriculum. What separates one CBSE school from another is whether the syllabus is a thing you can be handed — and Sunbeam publishes its own, class by class, under a name of its own: **PRECEPT**. One document for every class from Nursery to Class XII, so parents always know what their child is learning and why."
